=== Linear Resources ===
Resources marked with @resource must be consumed
Use 'ensure' for automatic cleanup

=== Successful Payment ===
Processing payment...
Committing transaction 1 for $100

=== Failed Payment ===
Processing payment...
Payment failed!
Rolling back transaction 2

=== Network Operation ===
Sending: Hello to example.com
Sending: World to example.com
Closing connection to example.com:8080

=== Manual Close ===
Sending: GET /data to api.example.com
Closing connection to api.example.com:443
After manual close

=== Files as Resources ===
Error: Bad file descriptor (os error 9)

=== Key Points ===
- @resource types must be explicitly consumed
- Prevents resource leaks at compile time
- 'ensure' guarantees cleanup on all exit paths
- Methods with 'take self' consume the resource
- Compiler error if resource not consumed

=== What This Prevents ===
- Forgetting to close files
- Forgetting to commit/rollback transactions
- Forgetting to release locks
- Forgetting to close network connections
- All checked at compile time!
